<title>CHINA: SOCCER-CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are Chinese</p>
<p>professional soccer league standings after games on Sunday</p>
<p>(tabulated under games played, won, drawn, lost, goals for,</p>
<p>goals against and points):</p>
<p> Dalian Wanda	  9   8   1   0   19   3   25</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua    9   3   5   1   13   5   14</p>
<p> Sichuan Quanxing    9   3   5   1   13   7   14</p>
<p> Beijing Guo'an	9   3   4   2   11  10   13</p>
<p> Qingdao Hainiu	9   3   3   3    7   6   12</p>
<p> Jinan Taishan	 9   3   3   3    7   8   12</p>
<p> Guangzhou Apollo    9   2   5   2    4   4   11</p>
<p> Vanguard Huandao    9   3   2   4    9  10   11</p>
<p> Yanbian Aodong	9   3   2   4    6   8   11</p>
<p> Tianjin Samsung     9   1   4   4    3   8    7</p>
<p> August First	  9   1   4   4    4   14   7</p>
<p> Guangdong Hongyuan  9   1   2   6    6   15   5</p>
